Zlib: gzip and deflate files and output compression, with the zlib
of the base system.

The module zlib of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/zlib.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/zlib.
